  "analytical_usefulness": 0.62,
  "source_groundedness": 0.62,
  "rationale": "Several columns (incident_category, failure_symptom, resolution_action_type) add real grouping/comparison axes aligned with the efficiency query and are largely grounded in short_description. Weak spots: caller_type merely restates caller identity, software_trigger is a low-leverage flag, and reassignment_occurred plus software_trigger assert facts not supported by the shown source fields, indicating hallucination risk. Overall moderate quality on both dimensions."
